CERN-OHL-S is *strongly reciprocal*: if you distribute a product made from a modified version
of this design, you must make the complete modified source available under the same licence.

## Documentation: CC-BY-4.0

Applies to: `docs/`, `images/`, `README.md` and the README files in each directory.

Share and adapt freely, with attribution.

## Not covered by any of the above

**Third-party libraries.** Footprints and symbols in `hardware/` derive from the KiCad
standard libraries, which carry their own licence (CC-BY-SA 4.0 with an exception for use in
designs; see https://www.kicad.org/libraries/license/). That exception is why boards using
them, including this one, are not forced to CC-BY-SA.

**Component 3D models.** Most models inside the files in `3d/` and the renders in `images/`
come from the KiCad standard library and are generic package bodies, not the exact
manufacturer parts. The models for F1 and L1 in `hardware/lib/3d/` were fetched from
EasyEDA/LCSC with easyeda2kicad and remain under their publishers' terms; they are not
relicensed here.
